{"id":"9a177f4739c6be55","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-always-true-modal.md","title":"Always True Modal Formulas","display":"df-always-true-modal — Always True Modal Formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-always-true-modal","aliases":["89-df-always-true-modal"],"display":"df-always-true-modal — Always True Modal Formulas","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-always-true-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-always-true-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-always-true-modal — Always True Modal Formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f581262c09d5e34\" href=\"?note=1f581262c09d5e34\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-arithmetical-realization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ce064881a79d6f7\" href=\"?note=0ce064881a79d6f7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-soundness\">89-df-arithmetical-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 使用固定 PA 可证明性谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models B\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models B\\)</span> 是外部标准模型满足关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}always\\text{-}true\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}always\\text{-}true\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 3 章，印刷页 64–65；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n总为真与总在 PA 中可证分别得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models\\)</span> 在元层使用；没有声称其可由 PA 内的全局真谓词定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"1f581262c09d5e34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-soundness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}always\\text{-}true\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid\n\\forall\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Real}(\\mathrm{PA})\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau(A))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AT}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PL}(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models","display":false}],"bytes":1115,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e926c452321080c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-always-true-modal]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-229","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-always-true-modal]]"}],"outgoing":["1f581262c09d5e34","0ce064881a79d6f7"]}